        <mxCell id="OTBJcb5RooeKvBM8wraD-99" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Roboto, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &amp;quot;Fira Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Droid Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;обслуживает статику фронтенда (React-приложения);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Roboto, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &amp;quot;Fira Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Droid Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Roboto, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &amp;quot;Fira Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Droid Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;обеспечивает быструю загрузку контента пользователям по всей стране;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Roboto, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &amp;quot;Fira Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Droid Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Roboto, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &amp;quot;Fira Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Droid Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;кэширует часть публичных API-ответов.&lt;/span&gt;" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;fontColor=#000000;darkOpacity=0.05;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;fillStyle=solid;direction=west;gradientDirection=north;gradientColor=#FFFFFF;shadow=1;size=20;pointerEvents=1;align=left;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="740" y="650" width="480" height="70" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="OTBJcb5RooeKvBM8wraD-100" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Roboto, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &amp;quot;Fira Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Droid Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;распределяет запросы между регионами по географии;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Roboto, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &amp;quot;Fira Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Droid Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Roboto, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &amp;quot;Fira Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Droid Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;включает health-check для определения активного региона;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Roboto, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &amp;quot;Fira Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Droid Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Roboto, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &amp;quot;Fira Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Droid Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;обеспечивает автоматический failover при недоступности региона;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Roboto, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &amp;quot;Fira Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Droid Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Roboto, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &amp;quot;Fira Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Droid Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;применяются rate-limit и WAF для защиты от перегрузок и DDoS.&lt;/span&gt;" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;fontColor=#000000;darkOpacity=0.05;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;fillStyle=solid;direction=west;gradientDirection=north;gradientColor=#FFFFFF;shadow=1;size=20;pointerEvents=1;align=left;" parent="1" vertex="1">
